  "date_confidence": "2 August 1895 is given independently by both Slovene lexicon entries at slovenska-biografija.si (SBL and PSBL, entry sbi629661) and by es.wikipedia. en.wikipedia's 14 January 1895 is uncited and is treated here as an error rather than an equal reading; the discrepancy is recorded, not resolved. Parentage follows both lexicons, 'kmetu Jožefu in Mariji r. Bogatec'. sl.wikipedia instead makes the father a fisherman named Josip who died nine months before Viktor's birth; sl.wikipedia's own nine-months clause in fact refers to the birth of the younger brother, and both lexicons make the father a farmer named Jožef. The aunt Marjana Sulčič as guardian rests on sl.wikipedia alone. Coordinate corrected to the village of Santa Croce; the research pool's 45.666/13.769 and 45.6167/13.85 fall about 9 km and 14 km away, in Trieste's outskirts and toward Muggia.",
